ARCHITECTURE kicom
COMPONENT chatgpt role="external reasoning/development client"
COMPONENT kicom_core role="KCL parser, policy enforcement, verifier and bounded action runtime"
COMPONENT genome role="trusted desired-state blueprint"
COMPONENT recovery_kernel role="independent root of trust"
COMPONENT immune_system role="drift detection and trusted-state repair"
COMPONENT goal_layer role="persistent permissionless goals from human, ChatGPT memory and system experience"
COMPONENT memory_archive role="append-only protected ChatGPT project-context snapshots"
COMPONENT human_authorization_bridge role="human authorization for protected external authority; FreeOTP retained as legacy/fallback implementation"
COMPONENT autonomy_envelope role="bounded internal work; legacy KCL session transport remains available while routine DEV uses passkey"
COMPONENT release_archive role="append-only kicomarchive install/update/source/hash/metadata history"
FLOW autonomy_session="legacy FreeOTP session transport -> rolling token -> bounded KCL operations; transport token is not a policy grant"
FLOW protected_external_action="exact action binding -> human authorization where required -> execute with revalidation"
FLOW release="build -> sandbox -> verifier -> install -> kicomarchive -> first-party feed -> optional mirror"
RULE "No arbitrary shell, SQL, filesystem paths or arbitrary URL proxy"
RULE "Workspace is non-web-executable; existing writes retain SHA-256 conflict protection"
RULE "Production targets remain allowlisted and human-authorized; current legacy implementation may use transaction-bound FreeOTP"
RULE "GitHub is optional transport/mirror, never a trust anchor"
RULE "Archive release paths are append-only and conflicts never overwrite history"
COMPONENT transaction_buffer role="inert bounded fragment buffer; commit executes existing patch allowlists with one main-session rotation"
FLOW bound_red_resume="prepared exact binding may outlive session idle up to 3600s -> fresh FreeOTP -> binding recheck -> execute"
COMPONENT adaptive_transport_profile role="per-client safe/probe fragment sizing with success learning, backoff feedback and idempotent retry"
COMPONENT session_totp_grace role="legacy session-opening compatibility; not an internal autonomy policy gate"
COMPONENT chat_update_transport role="first-class ChatGPT-to-KiCom update path with server-side authoring, chunked direct ZIP transfer and raw POST direct ZIP transfer"
COMPONENT update_supersession_archive role="protected metadata history for pending updates replaced by newer verified packages"
FLOW chat_authored_update="ChatGPT -> trusted source/build patches inside protected non-executable build -> release_prepare -> normal self-update verifier"
FLOW chat_zip_update="ChatGPT -> CHAT_UPDATE_RAW or CHAT_UPDATE_BEGIN/CHUNK/FINISH -> normal self-update verifier"
RULE "Slack, mail and GitHub are optional redundant transports and are not prerequisites for direct chat updates."
RULE "Transport should remain simple; verifier and protected action boundaries enforce authority."
RULE "Superseding a pending update preserves its metadata history."
COMPONENT sqlite_operational_memory role="primary mutable operational state and event store"
COMPONENT sqlite_healer role="integrity checks, snapshots, quarantine, restore and rebuild"
COMPONENT sqlite_evolution_lab role="shadow DB experiments with fitness and health-gated promotion"
FLOW sqlite_migration="JSON/JSONL -> import -> SQLite primary -> compatibility mirror"
FLOW sqlite_recovery="failure -> quarantine -> verified snapshot -> mirror import -> integrity check"
COMPONENT dev_zone role="trusted genome-covered DEV modules with WebAuthn passkey and reusable DEV-only sessions"
FLOW dev_entry="WebAuthn passkey -> DEV-scoped session -> fixed capability router"
COMPONENT slack_transport role="bounded optional transport/perception input; never authority"
COMPONENT mail_transport role="bounded optional transport with quarantine/verifier path; never authority"
COMPONENT opera_control_surface role="browser DEV/Admin control surface; never authority"
RULE "DEV sessions cannot grant production deployment, self-update-install, recovery, auth-admin or secret authority."
RULE "Technical risk class and authority boundary are separate dimensions."
RULE "Canonical KCL, Genome, secrets and immutable archives remain separate."
END_ARCHITECTURE kicom
